{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12319","headline":"送张五员外东归楚州 · 钱起","name":"送张五员外东归楚州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"缨佩不爲美，人羣宁免辞。\n杳然黄鹄去，未负白云期。\n此别清兴尽，高秋临水时。\n好山枉帆僻，浪迹到家迟。\n他日诏书下，梁鸿安可追。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12319.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12319","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}